{
  "id": "NUM.27",
  "number": "27",
  "bookId": "NUM",
  "reference": "Ekim. 27",
  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "27",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NUM 27"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "27",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋidwe a Selopead ŋulupesur",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae Selopead lokoku ka Eper, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Gilead, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Makir, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Manase, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Yosepu. Ayakar Selopead ŋidwe ŋulupesur bon; ŋirorwa kec ikes lu: Mala, Noa, Ogila, Milika ka Tirisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋidwe a Selopead ŋulupesur ŋul toloto towua alokiŋaren Moses, Eleasar esacaradoti, ŋikarikok a Ŋisirael ka atukot a Ŋisirael daadaŋ alokiŋaren eema ŋolokilipet temasi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abu papa kosi totwana analoŋisat, pa arae iŋes epei a ŋituŋa a ŋulu apotu tocunakinos toŋero Ekapolon kaapei ka Kora, nai atwani iŋes aŋuna ka asecit keŋ a elope, ido amamukar iŋes ŋidwe ŋulusapa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaanukiro nai elemarere ekiro a papa kosi anateker keŋ aŋuna pa auruunitor iŋes ŋidwe ŋulusapa? Inakinae isua akwap ŋina eruwor ŋina kosi lopite ŋolo aryamuniata ŋiyeneta a papa kosi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai Moses yau ŋakiro kec neni ke Ekapolon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ido tolimok Ekapolon Moses tema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iyookinito ŋidwe a Selopead anakiro aŋuna iŋitasi ikes, emaikina iyoŋ kire inak ikes akwap ŋina eruwor ŋina kec aneni a ŋiyeneta a papa kec, inak ikes akwap ŋina emaikina eruwor ŋina a papa kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimok daŋ Ŋisirael ŋakiro nu, ‘Ani ketwana ekile nyewuruuna ikoku ŋinisapat, emaikina iyoŋ inak neni a nakoku keŋ ŋalup a papa keŋ; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ani kemamukar ituŋanan ŋin tari ikoku ŋinipese, einakinio ŋalup keŋ neni a ŋikaitotoi keŋ; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani kemamukar iŋes tari ŋikaitotoi einakinio ŋalup neni a ŋikaitotoi a Papa keŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ani kemamukar papa keŋ ŋikaitotoi; einakinio ŋalup keŋ neni a iyenet a idio anateker keŋ a ekile a ŋol, ido eruwor ŋalup ŋun ŋuna a iyenet a ŋin. Eruwor ŋun ŋakiro ŋuna etubunitoe ka ekisil aŋuna a Ŋisirael lopite ŋolo ecikitor Ekapolon Moses.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Toseunae Yosua akilunyokin neni a Moses.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimok Ekapolon Moses tema, “Kitipeiyo kidiama lomoru ŋol, ŋolo enyaritae Abiram, ido kiŋolik akwap ŋina adau ayoŋ ainakin neni a Ŋisirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kidau iyoŋ akiŋolikin, itwani iyoŋ ikwapei ŋituŋa ŋulu atwaka, lopite ŋolo atwania lokaato kon Aron; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anerae ipotu iyoŋ ka Aron toŋero ŋakiro kaŋ, analoŋisat a ŋina a Sin apaki ŋina eŋuruŋurar atukot a Ŋisirael neni kaŋ, ipotu iyes nyikitopoloosi ayoŋ anasegis kaŋ alokiŋaren kec anakipi a ŋuna a Meriba.” (Erae ŋun ŋakipi a Meriba a ŋina alo Kades analoŋisat a Sin.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimok Moses Ekapolon tema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Elipi Ekapolon Akuj ŋina a ŋitai a ŋituŋa a daadaŋ, toseu ituŋanan ice ŋini epolokini atukot a Ŋisirael, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋini iŋarenikini ikes elosete lojie, ido toboŋunio, ŋini iŋarenikini ikes aloticisyo kec a daadaŋ ikotere ŋituŋa a Ekapolon nyikwaanikin ka ŋamesekin ŋuna emam ekeyokon.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun tolimok Ekapolon Moses tema, “Tonyarau Yosua lokoku a Nun, ekile ŋolo eyai etau ŋolo ka Akuj, tosodi kidokok ŋakan kon nakou keŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kitowo iŋes alokiŋaren Eleasar esacaradoti ka alokiŋaren atukot a Ŋisirael daadaŋ, tosodi tolimok iŋes epupete ka itete ŋituŋa daadaŋ ŋakiro ŋuna emaikina iŋes kitiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inak iŋes apolou kon ace, ikotere atukot a Ŋisirael daadaŋ iwuapi ŋuna elimuni iŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai, ewoi iŋes alokiŋaren Eleasar esacaradoti, ŋolo iŋitununui aŋuna keŋ ŋakiro anakisileerekinet a ŋina ke Ekapolon, mati kelimu iŋes atemar apena toloto nai Ŋisirael daadaŋ ka iŋes lojie ka mati kelimu iŋes atemar oboŋosi, iŋes nai eboŋunioto iŋes ka Ŋisirael daadaŋ alojie.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, abu Moses kitiya ikwapei ecikitor Ekapolon iŋes. Abu iŋes tonyarau Yosua, kitowo iŋes alokiŋaren Eleasar esacaradoti ka alokiŋaren atukot a Ŋisirael daadaŋ; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tosodi kidokok Moses ŋakan keŋ nakou a Yosua, ido tolimok iŋes ŋuna emaikina kitiya lopite ŋolo alimokinitor Ekapolon iŋes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
